WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:16.662
"This stinks!" Dipper said.

2
00:00:16.662 --> 00:00:21.183
"We're having a talent show.

3
00:00:21.184 --> 00:00:26.820
I need my music player!"

4
00:00:26.827 --> 00:00:30.724
"Let's check my junkyard," Gasser said.

5
00:00:30.724 --> 00:00:39.853
"Maybe we can find one there."

6
00:00:39.854 --> 00:00:54.754
The friends searched the junkyard.

7
00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:58.540
Gasser found a music player.

8
00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:01.191
"Thank you!" Dipper said.

9
00:01:01.191 --> 00:01:06.151
"I'll put it in later.

10
00:01:06.152 --> 00:01:08.962
Eddy, can you carry it?"

11
00:01:08.962 --> 00:01:13.451
Eddy nodded.

12
00:01:13.452 --> 00:01:16.151
Jeb lifted the music player.

13
00:01:16.151 --> 00:01:18.555
He put it in Eddy's dumper.

14
00:01:18.555 --> 00:01:22.068
Suddenly Jeb bumped a tire pile.

15
00:01:22.068 --> 00:01:25.294
One tire bounced onto Poppy.

16
00:01:25.294 --> 00:01:27.788
"Ouch!" Poppy said.

17
00:01:27.788 --> 00:01:31.128
Her hood got dented.

18
00:01:31.128 --> 00:01:43.954
"Sorry!" Jeb said.

19
00:01:43.954 --> 00:01:55.964
Gasser found Poppy a new hood.

20
00:01:55.964 --> 00:01:58.383
Jeb lifted the hood.

21
00:01:58.383 --> 00:02:00.947
He placed it in Eddy's dumper.

22
00:02:00.947 --> 00:02:03.087
Jeb looked at the hood.

23
00:02:03.087 --> 00:02:08.897
It balanced on the music player.

24
00:02:08.897 --> 00:02:18.481
Jeb told Eddy.

25
00:02:18.481 --> 00:02:21.485
Eddy grinned.

26
00:02:21.485 --> 00:02:27.324
"I have an idea, Jeb!" he said.
